════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  PART 1 — ONE-TIME SETUP (gawin mo lang ito ONCE)
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

1.1  INSTALL NGROK
     → Buksan: https://ngrok.com/download
     → Pindutin "Microsoft Store Installer"
     → Install mula sa Store

1.2  SIGN UP NGROK
     → Buksan: https://dashboard.ngrok.com/signup
     → Mag-sign up gamit email o Google

1.3  KUHAIN ANG AUTHTOKEN
     → Buksan: https://dashboard.ngrok.com/get-started/your-authtoken
     → Pindutin "Copy" button

1.4  I-SAVE ANG AUTHTOKEN SA PC
     → Buksan ang PowerShell
     → I-run: ngrok config add-authtoken <PASTE_TOKEN_HERE>
     → Dapat lumabas: "Authtoken saved..."

1.5  FIREWALL RULE (para sa LAN testing via IP)
     → Buksan PowerShell as Administrator
     → I-run:
       netsh advfirewall firewall add rule name="Flutter Web 8080" dir=in action=allow protocol=TCP localport=8080

