════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  PART 4 — MGA COMMON ISSUES AT FIX
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

❌  ERROR: "Site can't be reached"
    → Hindi tumatakbo ang ngrok
    → I-restart: Ctrl+C sa Terminal #2, tapos i-run ulit
      ngrok http 8080

❌  ERROR: "502 Bad Gateway"
    → Hindi tumatakbo ang Python server
    → Tignan ang Terminal #1, i-restart kung kailangan:
      python -m http.server 8080 --bind 0.0.0.0

❌  ERROR: "auth/unauthorized-domain"
    → Hindi pa na-add ang ngrok URL sa Firebase
    → Sundin ang Step 4 sa itaas
    → I-verify may TULDOK: lushly-festival-recycler.ngrok-free.dev

❌  ERROR: "Outside Work Zone" (location issue)
    → Nasa labas ka ng 1500m radius ng office
    → Gumamit ng Fake GPS app:
      1. Enable Developer Mode (Settings → About → Build number x7)
      2. Install "Fake GPS Location" mula Play Store
      3. Settings → Developer Options → Mock location app → Fake GPS
      4. Sa Fake GPS app: latitude=14.6114, longitude=120.9936
      5. Start button

❌  ERROR: White screen sa browser
    → Ctrl+Shift+R (hard refresh)
    → O kaya i-clear browser cache

❌  ERROR: "ngrok: command not found"
    → Hindi naka-install o wala sa PATH
    → I-install: MS Store → "ngrok"
    → O i-restart PowerShell

❌  ERROR: "adb: command not found"
    → Idagdag sa PATH (temporary):
      $env:Path += ";$env:LOCALAPPDATA\Android\Sdk\platform-tools"

